# Route: guide 44 of 49 of the simulator's completionist route for Troll (1199
# of 1215 eligible quests, 157.3 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 58 to 60, 46
# quests, 3.4 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Azshara, Durotar, Alterac Mountains, The Hinterlands, Hillsbrad
# Foothills, Feralas, Felwood): Shadowsong Shrine -> Valormok -> The Shattered
# Strand -> Southridge Beach -> Temple of Arkkoran -> Thalassian Base Camp ->
# Temple of Arkkoran -> Southridge Beach -> Valormok -> The Ruined Reaches ->
# Sen'jin Village -> Shaol'watha -> Shadra'Alor -> ….
#
# Optional (elite: grouping up is advised): The Name of the Beast (3510;
# Hetaera 55); The Crown of Will (520; Mug'thol 43).
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): Heart of Disruption (96984), The Grave Knight (96986),
# Opportunistic Education (96987), Jammal'an the Prophet (1446), The Grave
# Knight (96986), Pusillin and the Elder Azj'Tordin (7441), Elven Legends
# (7481), Lethtendris's Web (7489).

